 ## Search
 
-Search returns 50 results per page.
+Search returns 100 results per page (`PAGE_SIZE` in `app/config.py`).
 
 ## Address lookups
 
 Address lookups go to the Mapline geocoding API.
-Mapline's free tier allows 100 requests a minute per API key.
-A lookup gives up after 5 seconds.
+The portal sends at most 250 lookups a minute (`GEOCODE_REQUESTS_PER_MINUTE`),
+spaced 0.24 seconds apart.
+Mapline's free tier allows 100 requests a minute per API key, so the configured
+rate is above that free-tier limit.
+A lookup gives up after 10 seconds (`GEOCODE_TIMEOUT_SECONDS`).
 
 ## Account export
 
-The account export runs nightly at 02:00 UTC.
-Deleted accounts are left out of the export, as section 4 of the privacy policy requires.
+The account export starts nightly at 02:00 UTC (`EXPORT_HOUR_UTC`).
+It writes every account it receives, including deleted ones, which are marked
+by the `deleted` column. `export_accounts` does not filter deleted accounts out.
+Section 4 of the privacy policy requires deleted accounts to be left out of the export.
